OL,3,AAmazon rigged billions in ad pricing,
OL,4,Alawsuit from states and US watchdog
OL,5,Aalleges
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US Federal Trade Commission (FTC)
OL,8,Fand a bipartisan group of 22 states has
OL,9,Ffiled a lawsuit alleging Amazon
OL,10,Fsecretly overcharged more than a
OL,11,Fmillion advertising customers by
OL,12,Fmanipulating online auctions it uses to
OL,13,Fset ad prices.
OL,15,FThe FTC and states say in their lawsuit
OL,16,Ffiled Monday that the alleged scheme
OL,17,Fhas likely netted the company $20bn
OL,18,Ffrom advertising customers since 2019.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
